testdata/easyeda/
-----------------
C1525.json, C2040.json, C25804.json, C165948.json
    Unmodified responses from the public EasyEDA component API
    (https://easyeda.com/api/products/<LCSC>/components). Component data ©
    LCSC / EasyEDA and the respective part manufacturers; kept verbatim so the
    importer tests run offline.
